# Theme Stage 0 Snapshot Checklist

# Purpose
#:layer #!pragmatics

Record Stage 0 (Functional) visuals for each theme.
Use this baseline to compare Stage 1+ behavior later.

# Capture notes
- Stage: 0 (Functional)
- Badge: On
- Capture: full app viewport
- Key states: editor focused, inspector focused, context focused
- Record: filename + quick notes

